`apps/web/src/palette.css` ends with 43 colours (from 50). The 25 Tailwind defaults give way to material colours: jade for good and ready, lacquer for damage and danger, ink for information, and verdigris, copper, amethyst and pale brass for the rest. Each old name's uses move to the colour that keeps their meaning. A one-off script moves the names and migrates literals, bringing `UNMIGRATED` to 861 (≤ 935, no entry grows). `palette.test.ts` fails on any of the Tailwind values, `PALETTE_MAX` is 43, and the AA test still passes. Card art, owned cosmetics, playmats and card versions keep their colours (new ruling R5012000, amending R3331000). The change ships with a `--visual` fragment.

